+## Withdrawing a result that should not have counted
+
+```ts
+const { service } = createArena();
+service.publishLeaderboard("tnm_cup", 1_720_000_000_000);
+service.voidMatch({
+  matchId: "mch_7",
+  at: 1_720_000_000_500,
+  reason: "opponent disconnected before the first round",
+});
+service.leaderboard("tnm_cup");
+service.voidHistory("tnm_cup");
+```
+
+Publish before you void. The board handed back afterwards measures movement
+against the published one, so an operator reading it sees where players moved
+relative to the standings they were shown, not relative to an intermediate
+board the void has already thrown away.
+
+The rebuild is not a subtraction. Awards are decided again from the results
+that remain, so a streak bonus a later win only reached because of the voided
+one comes back out, and a player left with nothing at all gets a fresh record
+stamped at the moment of the void.
+
